---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<figure class="race card" data-demo>
  <div class="race__head">
    <div>
      <p class="race__title">入场缓动</p>
      <p class="race__sub">同一段位移，两条曲线</p>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="race__replay" data-demo-replay>
      <Icon name="arrows-clockwise" size={14} />
      重播
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="race__rows">
    <div class="race__row">
      <div class="race__meta">
        <span class="chip">错的</span>
        <span class="race__curve num">ease-in</span>
      </div>
      <div class="race__track">
        <svg class="race__curve-line" viewBox="0 0 100 34" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 1, 1)：时间走 x，进度走 y（底 34 → 顶 0） -->
          <path d="M0 34 C42 34 100 0 100 0" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />
        </svg>
        <span class="race__dot" data-anim style="--ease: cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 1, 1)"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="race__why">起步迟疑，结尾突然加速。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="race__row">
      <div class="race__meta">
        <span class="chip race__chip-ok">对的</span>
        <span class="race__curve num">ease-out</span>
      </div>
      <div class="race__track">
        <svg class="race__curve-line race__curve-line--ok" viewBox="0 0 100 34" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.58, 1) -->
          <path d="M0 34 C0 34 58 0 100 0" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />
        </svg>
        <span class="race__dot race__dot-ok" data-anim style="--ease: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.58, 1)"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="race__why">立刻响应，然后减速停稳。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="race__foot">
    入场元素应当先快后慢地落位。用反了曲线，界面就会慢半拍，而你说不出为什么。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .race {
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .race__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .race__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .race__sub {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .race__replay {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 30px;
    padding-inline: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      color 0.18s ease,
      border-color 0.18s ease;
  }

  .race__replay:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }

  [data-demo-static] .race__replay {
    display: none;
  }

  .race__rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-block: 20px;
  }

  .race__meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .race__chip-ok {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  .race__curve {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .race__track {
    container-type: inline-size;
    position: relative;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--sunken);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .race__track::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    top: 6px;
    bottom: 6px;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .race__curve-line {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .race__curve-line path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 30%, transparent);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .race__curve-line--ok path {
    stroke: color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 62%, transparent);
  }

  .race__dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    top: 50%;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-top: -10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 62%, transparent);
    --travel: calc(100cqw - 46px);
  }

  .race__dot-ok {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .race__dot.is-run {
    animation: race-slide 1000ms var(--ease) 120ms both;
  }

  @keyframes race-slide {
    from {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    to {
      transform: translateX(var(--travel));
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .race__dot.is-run {
      animation: none;
      transform: translateX(var(--travel));
    }
  }

  .race__why {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .race__foot {
    padding-top: 14px;

    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>

<script>
  import '../scripts/demos';
</script>
